  "faq_que_1": "What is Abacus Kids - Mental Math?",
  "faq_ans_1": "Abacus Kids - Mental Math is an educational app designed to help children learn math skills through interactive abacus exercises and activities.",
  "faq_que_2": "Do I need to subscribe to use the app?",
  "faq_ans_2": "While the app offers some free content, a subscription plan provides access to premium features and a more comprehensive learning experience.",
  "faq_que_3": "How do I subscribe to the premium plan?",
  "faq_ans_3": "To subscribe to the premium plan, go to the \"Subscription\" section in the app, choose your preferred plan, and follow the on-screen instructions. Payments are processed securely through our integrated payment gateway.",
  "faq_que_4": "What payment methods are accepted for the subscription?",
  "faq_ans_4": "We accept various payment methods, including credit cards, debit cards, and other secure payment options available through our payment gateway.  Check support and not support payment methods : https://support.google.com/googleplay/topic/3365267",
  "faq_que_41": "Why is my payment method not supported for subscription?",
  "faq_ans_41": "Certain payment methods may not be supported due to limitations imposed by the payment processing system. We recommend using one of the supported methods available in the app. Check support and not support payment methods : https://support.google.com/googleplay/topic/3365267",
  "faq_que_42": "Can I contact support to inquire about alternative payment methods?",
  "faq_ans_42": "Absolutely. If you encounter issues with payment methods, feel free to contact our customer support team at %1$s. They can provide guidance and explore potential solutions.",
  "faq_que_5": "Is my payment information secure?",
  "faq_ans_5": "Yes, we prioritize the security of your payment information. Our payment gateway employs industry-standard encryption to ensure a secure and safe transaction process.",
  "faq_que_6": "Are there advertisements in the app?",
  "faq_ans_6": "No, there are no advertisements in the application.",
  "faq_que_7": "How do I log in to my account?",
  "faq_ans_7": "On \"Login\" page, login with your google account or if you have credentials then enter your credentials (username and password), and click \"Submit.\"",
  "faq_que_8": "What benefits do subscribers enjoy?",
  "faq_ans_8": "Subscribers enjoy benefits such as unlimited access to premium content, an ad-free experience, personalized learning features, and more interactive exercises.",
  "faq_que_9": "Can I cancel my subscription at any time?",
  "faq_ans_9": "Yes, you can cancel your subscription at any time if you subscribe from application only. Simply go to the \"https://play.google.com/store/account/subscriptions\" and \"Cancel Subscription.\" Your subscription will remain active until the end of the current billing cycle.",
  "faq_que_10": "Is there a workaround if my payment method is not supported?",
  "faq_ans_10": "Unfortunately, if your payment method is not supported, we recommend using one of the available alternatives. Our support team can assist you in exploring options and addressing any concerns you may have.",
  "faq_que_support": "If you have any further questions or concerns, please reach out to our customer support team at %1$s."
 },
